OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening with some
OL,7,Fpatchy light rain possible. Staying
OL,8,Flargely cloudy overnight with further
OL,9,Foutbreaks of light rain. A milder
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy with rain at
OL,13,Ftimes, likely turning heavier and more
OL,14,Fpersistent later. Quite breezy around
OL,15,Fthe coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
