OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Wednesday with rain, brightening up
OL,7,Flater. Mostly dry with bright spells
OL,8,Fon Thursday, but a few showers in the
OL,9,Fwest. Becoming rather wet and windy on
OL,10,FFriday.
